🇯🇵🇺🇸🇷🇺⚡️ — The Soviet Union is to blame for the United States dropping a nuclear bomb on Japan, according to Arima Tetsuo, a professor at Waseda University and a researcher of US and UK archives.

According to him, he adopted this viewpoint from Americans and will now advocate for it in Japan, placing the responsibility for the dropping of the nuclear bomb on Russia.

